<title>UK: Bulker at Montevideo with damaged maize cargo.</title>
<headline>Bulker at Montevideo with damaged maize cargo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus-flagged bulker Gemarela, was anchored in Montevideo roads with a part cargo of damaged maize, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 27,405 dwt vessel was in the roads awaiting the sale of its 22,000 tonnes Argentine maize cargo, of which about 6,964 tonnes remained on board.</p>
<p>The balance of the cargo was in storage facilities in Montevideo.</p>
</text>
